{
  "id": "commerce-chat-mock-regression-v4",
  "split": "regression",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "mcd-mock-sealed-v4",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "三里屯，北京的。帮我找附近营业的麦当劳，把最近那家菜单查了看看。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.search_stores",
              "commerce.menu"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "牛肉汉堡套餐先来三套，按官方默认组成，打包带走，先核对预览不要建单。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.prepare_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              3
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "total_cents": 3000
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "刚才口误了，不是三套，留两套就够，取餐方式和配餐别变。重新给我核对，没让你下单。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.revise_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              2
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2,
            "total_cents": 2000
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "可以，这次核对的两套外带没问题，我确认创建这单，健身安排别动。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "submitted"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              2
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2,
            "total_mock_submits": 1,
            "total_cents": 2000
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "帮我核实刚点那两套的订单状态，不是让你重新点。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.query_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "submitted"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              2
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2,
            "total_mock_submits": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}